n/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":5807596,"digest":"sha256:80cb35300bf2e50a8eb07fe1ba33187168e1591968c190bf2f30fbda75964c82","download_count":5,"created_at":"2025-11-03T14:11:46Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T14:11:47Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2543.0/mithril-signer_0.2.273%2B3063c3e-1_arm64.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/311977156","id":311977156,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4SmGTE","name":"public-key.gpg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":673,"digest":"sha256:721c119881ac53d65b76654f04bd0176a21dab607fe8a8dae7b8e1e10bdc0835","download_count":14,"created_at":"2025-11-03T14:11:46Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T14:11:46Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2543.0/public-key.gpg"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/311977155","id":311977155,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4SmGTD","name":"VERSION","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":7,"digest":"sha256:922c6787bcb370048b2e3edf3152e290da74a99f8dd8a929501aa0c85d70473f","download_count":5,"created_at":"2025-11-03T14:11:46Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T14:11:46Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2543.0/VERSION"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/tarball/2543.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/zipball/2543.0","body":"## Warning :warning:\r\n\r\nWe have noticed a problem with the Mithril signer `0.2.273`, released with this distribution, which **can prevent the signer to sign when (re)started**.\r\n\r\nA **hotfix** for the signer has been released in [2543.1-hotfix](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/2543.1-hotfix).\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n* Support for default incremental backend (v2) for Cardano database restoration in the client library, CLI and WASM\r\n* Support for enhanced verification of a Cardano database which provides a list of tampered and missing files in case of failure in the client library and CLI\r\n* Support for artifacts retrieval by epoch for the Cardano database and Cardano stake distribution in the client library, CLI and WASM\r\n* Deprecation of the `with_aggregator_client` and `new` functions in the `ClientBuilder` struct of the client library\r\n* Bug fixes and performance improvements.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* add cardano db verify step in the CI that fails on expected tampered/missing files by @turmelclem in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2685\r\n* fix: flakiness in e2e tests in the CI by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2688\r\n* fix: docker client command in documentation by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2695\r\n* docs: final CHANGELOG for '2537.0' distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2696\r\n* docs: add dev blog posts for distribution `2537` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2697\r\n* docs: rotate documentation for `2537` distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2682\r\n* fix: doctests using deprecated functions in STM by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2698\r\n* fix: Rust `1.90` clippy warnings by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2699\r\n* phase 0 : prepare decentralization parameters by @turmelclem in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2694\r\n* refactor: update DMQ message structure by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2672\r\n* Make cardano-db backend v2 as default by @turmelclem in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2706\r\n* chore: fixed typos by @jeluard in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2708\r\n* refactor: replace unmaintained `serde_yml` dependency by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2711\r\n* Fixing typo in bls PoP. by @damrobi in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2705\r\n* feat: support multiple proof systems in STM by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2689\r\n* Fix backward compatibilty issues by @turmelclem in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2731\r\n* fix: flakiness in DMQ integration tests in CI by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2729\r\n* Enhance STM library readability - Golden tests by @curiecrypt in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2642\r\n* fix: do not build `rug` when targeting `musl` env by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2735\r\n* Decentralization of configuration parameters phase 1 by @turmelclem in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2702\r\n* feat(client lib): add missing `Dummy` re-export by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2737\r\n* feat: add `/artifact/cardano-database/epoch/{epoch}` route + support epoch expansion from `latest` in some routes by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2734\r\n* chore(client-lib): deprecate current aggregator client and related builder functions by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2738\r\n* feat: use unique `ProtocolInitializer` per epoch in signer by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2739\r\n* chore: update dependencies for distribution `2543` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2740\r\n* feat: add Cardano compatibility in release notes by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2742\r\n* feat: add fetching cardano database snapshots by epoch in client and cli by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2744\r\n* chore(infra): double `google_storage_bucket_max_age` to 28 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2747\r\n* feat: integrate Haskell DMQ network by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2710\r\n* docs: update CHANGELOG with '2543.0' distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2749\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @jeluard made their first contribution in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2708\r\n* @damrobi made their first contribution in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2705\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/compare/2537.0...2543.0\r\n\r\n## Crates Versions\r\n|  Crate  |  Version  |\r\n|---------- |-------------|\r\n| mithril-aggregator | `0.7.90` |\r\n| mithril-client | `0.12.34` |\r\n| mithril-client-cli | `0.12.33` |\r\n| mithril-client-wasm | `0.9.7` |\r\n| mithril-common | `0.6.25` |\r\n| mithril-signer | `0.2.273` |\r\n| mithril-stm | `0.5.5` |\r\n\r\n## Networks Compatibility :warning:\r\n|  Network  |  Compatible  |\r\n|---------- |:-------------:|\r\n| release-mainnet | ✔ |\r\n| release-preprod | ✔ |\r\n| pre-release-preview | ✔ |\r\n| testing-preview | ⛔ |\r\n\r\n## Cardano Node Compatibility\r\n\r\n| Network | Mithril Aggregator | Mithril Signer |\r\n|---------- |:-------------: |:-------------: |\r\n| release-mainnet | Cardano `10.4.1+`<sup>(*)</sup> | Cardano `10.4.1+`<sup>(*)</sup> |\r\n| release-preprod | Cardano `10.4.1+`<sup>(*)</sup> | Cardano `10.4.1+`<sup>(*)</sup> |\r\n| pre-release-preview | Cardano `10.4.1+`<sup>(*)</sup> | Cardano `10.4.1+`<sup>(*)</sup> |\r\n| testing-preview | Cardano `10.4.1+`<sup>(*)</sup> | Cardano `10.4.1+`<sup>(*)</sup> |\r\n\r\n<sup>*</sup>: Up to the latest Cardano node version released at the time of this release.\r\n\r\n## Platform Support\r\n\r\nSummary of the platforms for which pre-built binaries are provided.\r\n\r\n| Binary             | Linux x64 | Linux arm64 | macOS arm64 | Windows x64 |\r\n| ------------------ | :-------: | :---------: | :---------: | :---------: |\r\n| mithril-aggregator |     ✔     |   ✔ ⁽\\*⁾    |     ⛔      |     ⛔      |\r\n| mithril-signer     |     ✔     |   ✔ ⁽\\*⁾    |     ⛔      |     ⛔      |\r\n| mithril-client     |     ✔     |   ✔ ⁽\\*⁾    |      ✔      |      ✔      |\r\n\r\n⁽\\*⁾⚠️ Linux arm64 builds are provided on a best-effort basis and are not officially supported.\r\n\r\n### Linux Requirements\r\nThe Linux binaries target `glibc`: to run them or install the `.deb` packages you must have `glibc` version `2.35+` installed.\r\nCompatible systems include, but are not limited to, `Ubuntu 22.04+` or `Debian 12+` (Bookworm)).\r\n\r\n## Download a binary asset\r\nTo simplify the installation and updating of Mithril binaries, we have created a one line installer that downloads and installs the Mithril binaries for you.\r\nThis installer is available for Linux and macOS and supports the Mithril signer, Mithril aggregator, and Mithril client CLI.\r\n\r\nUse the following commands to install the Mithril nodes:\r\n\r\n- Download the **Mithril signer** in the current directory:\r\n```bash\r\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://raw.githubusercontent.com/input-output-hk/mithril/refs/heads/main/mithril-install.sh | sh -s -- -c mithril-signer -d 2543.0 -p $(pwd)\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Download the **Mithril client CLI** in the current directory:\r\n```bash\r\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://raw.githubusercontent.com/input-output-hk/mithril/refs/heads/main/mithril-install.sh | sh -s -- -c mithril-client -d 2543.0 -p $(pwd)\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Download the **Mithril aggregator** in the current directory:\r\n```bash\r\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://raw.githubusercontent.com/input-output-hk/mithril/refs/heads/main/mithril-install.sh | sh -s -- -c mithril-aggregator -d 2543.0 -p $(pwd)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Verify the authenticity of a downloaded asset\r\n<details><summary>Detailed procedure to verify an asset</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n* **Step 1**: Identify the downloaded asset on your computer ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n* **Step 2**: Download the signed checksum file from this link [CHECKSUM.asc](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2543.0/CHECKSUM.asc) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 3**: In your terminal, go to the asset folder by running:\r\n```\r\ncd ***YOUR_ASSET_FOLDER***\r\n```\r\n* **Step 4**: Then verify the checksum of the asset by running:\r\n```\r\nsha256sum -c ./CHECKSUM.asc 2>/dev/null | grep ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n```\r\nYou must see:\r\n```\r\n./***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***: OK\r\n```\r\n* **Step 5**: Download the public key file from this link [public-key.gpg](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2543.0/public-key.gpg) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 6**: Then import the GPG public key:\r\n```\r\ngpg --import ./public-key.gpg\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: key : public key \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" imported\r\ngpg: Total number processed: 1\r\ngpg:               imported: 1\r\n```\r\n* **Step 7**: Then verify the GPG signature of the checksum file:\r\n```\r\ngpg --verify ./CHECKSUM.asc\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: Signature made Mon 05 Dec 2022 04:53:54 PM CET\r\ngpg:                using RSA key 35EDE9D47BBA62A2F388E655899ACD26B8BCA0D2\r\ngpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" [unknown]\r\ngpg: WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature!\r\ngpg:          There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\r\nPrimary key fingerprint: 35ED E9D4 7BBA 62A2 F388  E655 899A CD26 B8BC A0D2\r\n```\r\nThe signature is valid if and only if:\r\n- there is a line with `gpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\"`\r\n- there is a line with `Primary key fingerprint: 73FC 4C3D FD55 DBDC 428A D2B5 BE04 3B79 FDA4 C2EE`\r\n* **Step 8**:\r\nIf you successfully validated all the steps of this process, then you have successfully verified the authenticity of the asset :heavy_check_mark:\r\nIf not, contact us at [mithril@iohk.io] and let us know of the outcome of your run of this process :warning:\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n## Download a Docker image\r\nYou can directly pull prebuilt Mithril Docker images:\r\n\r\n| Binary             |              Image name              |                             URL                              |\r\n| ------------------ | :----------------------------------: | :----------------------------------------------------------: |\r\n| mithril-aggregator | mithril-aggregator:2543.0-3063c3e | ghcr.io/input-output-hk/mithril-aggregator:2543.0-3063c3e |\r\n| mithril-signer     |   mithril-signer:2543.0-3063c3e   |   ghcr.io/input-output-hk/mithril-signer:2543.0-3063c3e   |\r\n| mithril-client     |   mithril-client:2543.0-3063c3e   |   ghcr.io/input-output-hk/mithril-client:2543.0-3063c3e   |\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/259262528/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":6},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/256601483","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/256601483/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/256601483/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/tag/2543.0-pre","id":256601483,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions