rl":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":6238268,"digest":null,"download_count":2,"created_at":"2025-04-29T15:19:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T15:19:05Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2517.0-pre/mithril-relay_0.1.42%2B47178ad-1_amd64.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/250455276","id":250455276,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4O7aTs","name":"mithril-signer_0.2.243+47178ad-1_amd64.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":5811144,"digest":null,"download_count":2,"created_at":"2025-04-29T15:19:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T15:19:05Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2517.0-pre/mithril-signer_0.2.243%2B47178ad-1_amd64.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/250455274","id":250455274,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4O7aTq","name":"public-key.gpg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":673,"digest":null,"download_count":6,"created_at":"2025-04-29T15:19:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T15:19:04Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2517.0-pre/public-key.gpg"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/250455280","id":250455280,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4O7aTw","name":"VERSION","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":11,"digest":null,"download_count":2,"created_at":"2025-04-29T15:19:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T15:19:04Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2517.0-pre/VERSION"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/tarball/2517.0-pre","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/zipball/2517.0-pre","body":"## Highlights:\r\n- ⚠️ **Breaking** changes in Mithril client CLI and library:\r\n  - To fast bootstrap a Cardano node, the new `--include-ancillary` option has been added to the _Cardano node database_ command in the Mithril client CLI.\r\n  - Without this option, only final immutable files are downloaded, and the ledger state must be computed from the genesis block when the Cardano node starts.\r\n  - The `--include-ancillary` option requires the usage of an **ancillary verification key** (`--ancillary-verification-key` or `ANCILLARY_VERIFICATION_KEY`) which is specified in the [Networks configuration](https://mithril.network/doc/next/manual/getting-started/network-configurations) page.\r\n  - Clients from distribution [`2513`] and earlier are **not compatible** with this change and **must be updated**.\r\n- Support for `Cardano node` `10.3.1` in the signer and the aggregator\r\n- Support for origin tags in Mithril client library, CLI and WASM to record the origin of client requests.\r\n- Bug fixes and performance improvements.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* feat: Separate location for ancillary for cardano database v1 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2380\r\n* refactor: prepare ancillary signing by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2393\r\n* Chore: bump `glibc` requirement to `2.35+` in one-line installer by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2387\r\n* Docs: rotate documentation for `2513` distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2390\r\n* docs: final CHANGELOG for `2513.0` distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2395\r\n* Docs: add dev blog post for distribution `2513` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2396\r\n* Feat(e2e): support multiple aggregators in the e2e tests by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2378\r\n* Docs: fix website documentation by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2397\r\n* feat: Sign ancillary files in aggregator by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2394\r\n* Fix(infra): fix aggregator crash at startup in `testing-preview` network by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2399\r\n* chore: anticipate rust `1.86` by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2398\r\n* Refactor: rename `master/slave` signer registration by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2400\r\n* Feat(infra): split ssh keys for testing/production by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2401\r\n* chore(infra): add ssh key for 'testing' and 'production' by @turmelclem in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2404\r\n* Organize STM - Blst multi_sig module by @curiecrypt in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2405\r\n* Feat: record origin of client requests in metrics by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2411\r\n* CI: include `CardanoDatabase` in the backward compatibility test  by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2413\r\n* Feat: include origin tag header for aggregator prover benchmark by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2416\r\n* explorer: support latest ancillary & cardano database v2 developments by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2418\r\n* fix(aggregator): incorrect immutable files average and total size in cardano database v2 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2419\r\n* Docs: blog post for the Cardano node database v2 certification by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2417\r\n* Feat(infra): support `follower` aggregator in infra by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2407\r\n* Fix: signer infra volumes configuration by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2420\r\n* feat: Verify ancillary artifacts in client by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2414\r\n* Fix aggregator path in stress test by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2421\r\n* Refactor: Simplify the configuration of commands in aggregator by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2423\r\n* Refactor: Simplify the configuration of tools/era commands in aggregator by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2434\r\n* fix(aggregator): ancillary signing on evolving files by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2425\r\n* feat(aggregator): Sign ancillary with GCP Kms by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2431\r\n* Simplify injection container in aggregator by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2435\r\n* Refactor: Simplify the configuration of genesis command in aggregator by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2432\r\n* Doc: update Cardano node database v2 dev blog post by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2439\r\n* Refactor: renaming and update aggregator node documentation by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2438\r\n* refactor: shared workspace dependencies by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2440\r\n* Feat: support GCP KMS ancillary signature in infrastructure by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2433\r\n* doc(website): update cardano node boostrap page with ancillary verification by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2441\r\n* Chore: update dependencies for distribution `2517` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2443\r\n* refactor: move SignaturePublisher to a dedicated module by @turmelclem in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2437\r\n* Feat: Support Cardano node `10.3.1` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2447\r\n* test: use a in memory logger for tests that needs to check logs by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2442\r\n* Docs: update CHANGELOG for `2517.0` distribution release by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2444\r\n* Feat: support custom origin tags in infra by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2448\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @turmelclem made their first contribution in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2404\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/compare/2513.0...2517.0-pre\r\n\r\n## Crates Versions\r\n|  Crate  |  Version  |\r\n|---------- |-------------|\r\n| mithril-aggregator | `0.7.44` |\r\n| mithril-client | `0.12.0` |\r\n| mithril-client-cli | `0.12.0` |\r\n| mithril-client-wasm | `0.9.0` |\r\n| mithril-common | `0.5.27` |\r\n| mithril-signer | `0.2.243` |\r\n| mithril-stm | `0.3.45` |\r\n\r\n## Networks Compatibility :warning:\r\n|  Network  |  Compatible  |\r\n|---------- |:-------------:|\r\n| release-mainnet | ⛔ |\r\n| release-preprod | ⛔ |\r\n| pre-release-preview | ✔ |\r\n| testing-preview | ⛔ |\r\n\r\n## Distributions Compatibility :warning:\r\n| Compatibility | mithril-signer | mithril-client |\r\n| --- | :---: | :---: |\r\n| `2513.0` | :heavy_check_mark: | :no_entry: |\r\n| `2506.0` | :heavy_check_mark: | :no_entry: |\r\n| `2450.0` | :heavy_check_mark: | :no_entry: |\r\n\r\n## Linux Requirements\r\nThe Linux binaries target `glibc`: to run them or install the `.deb` packages you must have `glibc` version `2.35+` installed.\r\nCompatible systems include, but are not limited to, `Ubuntu 22.04+` or `Debian 12+` (Bookworm)).\r\n\r\n## Verify the authenticity of a downloaded asset\r\n<details><summary>Detailed procedure to verify an asset</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n* **Step 1**: Identify the downloaded asset on your computer ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n* **Step 2**: Download the signed checksum file from this link [CHECKSUM.asc](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2517.0-pre/CHECKSUM.asc) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 3**: In your terminal, go to the asset folder by running:\r\n```\r\ncd ***YOUR_ASSET_FOLDER***\r\n```\r\n* **Step 4**: Then verify the checksum of the asset by running:\r\n```\r\nsha256sum -c ./CHECKSUM.asc 2>/dev/null | grep ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n```\r\nYou must see:\r\n```\r\n./***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***: OK\r\n```\r\n* **Step 5**: Download the public key file from this link [public-key.gpg](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2517.0-pre/public-key.gpg) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 6**: Then import the GPG public key:\r\n```\r\ngpg --import ./public-key.gpg\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: key : public key \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" imported\r\ngpg: Total number processed: 1\r\ngpg:               imported: 1\r\n```\r\n* **Step 7**: Then verify the GPG signature of the checksum file:\r\n```\r\ngpg --verify ./CHECKSUM.asc\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: Signature made Mon 05 Dec 2022 04:53:54 PM CET\r\ngpg:                using RSA key 35EDE9D47BBA62A2F388E655899ACD26B8BCA0D2\r\ngpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" [unknown]\r\ngpg: WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature!\r\ngpg:          There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\r\nPrimary key fingerprint: 35ED E9D4 7BBA 62A2 F388  E655 899A CD26 B8BC A0D2\r\n```\r\nThe signature is valid if and only if:\r\n- there is a line with `gpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\"`\r\n- there is a line with `Primary key fingerprint: 73FC 4C3D FD55 DBDC 428A D2B5 BE04 3B79 FDA4 C2EE`\r\n* **Step 8**:\r\nIf you successfully validated all the steps of this process, then you have successfully verified the authenticity of the asset :heavy_check_mark:\r\nIf not, contact us at [mithril@iohk.io] and let us know of the outcome of your run of this process :warning:\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/215518631/