l-signer_0.2.237%2B1fb85a7-1_amd64.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/240647740","id":240647740,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4OV_48","name":"public-key.gpg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":673,"digest":null,"download_count":3,"created_at":"2025-03-25T14:10:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T14:10:15Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2513.0-pre/public-key.gpg"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/240647736","id":240647736,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4OV_44","name":"VERSION","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":11,"digest":null,"download_count":2,"created_at":"2025-03-25T14:10:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T14:10:15Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2513.0-pre/VERSION"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/tarball/2513.0-pre","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/zipball/2513.0-pre","body":"## Highlights:\r\n- ⚠️ **Breaking** changes in Mithril nodes:\r\n  - Upgraded the **minimum required** `glibc` version from `2.31` to `2.35` for the pre-built Linux binaries\r\n  - Mithril signer with versions `<=0.2.200` **must be updated** following the cleanup of `Thales` era legacy code\r\n  - Mithril client library `with_snapshot_uploader` function has been renamed to `with_file_uploader`.\r\n- Support for `Cardano node` `10.2.1` in the signer and the aggregator\r\n- End support for **macOS x64 pre-built binaries** for the client CLI\r\n- Bug fixes and performance improvements.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* refactor(aggregator): simplify dependency builder by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2288\r\n* Reduce e2e flakiness by changing protocol parameters by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2301\r\n* Fix mithril-aggregator genesis bootstrap flakiness in e2e tests by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2303\r\n* Chore: update SSH keys in infra by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2305\r\n* fix: stm tests run time regression by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2307\r\n* Docs: rotate documentation for `2506` distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2283\r\n* Docs: final CHANGELOG for '2506.0' distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2311\r\n* chore(ci): reactivate publish test for `mithril-client` by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2310\r\n* explorer: use main `mithril-client-wasm` package by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2309\r\n* Mithril dev blog review by @oduameh in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2302\r\n* Docs: add dev blog post for distribution `2506` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2312\r\n* Docs: add dev blog post for certificate chain security advisory by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2313\r\n* Use a unique name for the cloud location of digests artifacts Cardano database by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2314\r\n* Cleanup unused dependencies and auto CI check by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2315\r\n* Split `mithril-common` crate by extracting some modules by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2304\r\n* Replace the `TODO` by a explanation of the limits by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2308\r\n* ci: Bump build runner to ubuntu 22.04 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2317\r\n* chore: upgrade dockerfiles base image version to Debian 12 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2319\r\n* `testing-sanchonet` network decommission by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2300\r\n* End support for MacOS x64 pre-built binaries by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2277\r\n* feat: client library for incremental Cardano database by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2289\r\n* refactor(ci): use cache-version instead of 'v0-' in rust cache key prefix by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2323\r\n* Fix wasm build in rust 1.85 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2326\r\n* feat: Implement an Unknown variant in the artifact locations by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2320\r\n* Docs: add new `Mithril certification` section in website by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2324\r\n* Feat: Support Cardano node `10.2.1` pre-release by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2336\r\n* feat: incremental cardano database restoration with client CLI by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2318\r\n* Minor editing/formatting improvements by @olgahryniuk in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2338\r\n* Docs: add page for Cardano node database v2 certification by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2339\r\n* Feat: add example crate for incremental Cardano database by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2337\r\n* Cleanup legacy code from thales era by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2340\r\n* Enhance artifact structure for incremental cardano db by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2341\r\n* Feat: improve disk space calculation for Incremental DB Restoration by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2345\r\n* fix: not blocking when computing size by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2346\r\n* Test: add integration test for incremental Cardano database in `mithril-client` by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2344\r\n* Fix: Hydra CI fails with OpenSSL error (Linux x86_64) by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2348\r\n* Fix: `notify-on-failure` job succeeds despite email sending failure by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2349\r\n* Code ADR for mithril-common by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2343\r\n* Use consistent naming in the client cardano database api by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2347\r\n* Docs: update clients documentation for incremental Cardano DB by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2350\r\n* Chore: enhance versions bump script by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2355\r\n* Feat: implement aggregator `slave` signer registration mode by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2351\r\n* Remove flakiness on should delay between retries tests by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2352\r\n* Docs: add features documentation for `mithril-client` library by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2358\r\n* refactor(mithril-client): Optimize cardano db artifacts download by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2359\r\n* Fix BLST bindings: Error handling for infinite values of sigs and vks by @curiecrypt in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2322\r\n* Compress the digests file uploaded on gcp by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2367\r\n* Feat: verify minimum node version with squash database migration by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2368\r\n* Reduce flakiness in the ci by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2370\r\n* Refactor(aggregator): groundwork for ancillary signature  by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2372\r\n* Feat: move database vacuum to aggregator startup to avoid API interruptions during epoch transitions by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2375\r\n* Organize STM code by @curiecrypt in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2373\r\n* Macro to implement the source trait by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2377\r\n* Reduce flakiness in tests by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2379\r\n* Organize STM code - Merkle Tree Module by @curiecrypt in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2374\r\n* Error messages as warning in signer by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2381\r\n* Feat: Support Cardano node `10.2.1` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2386\r\n* refactor(aggregator): remove deprecated `configuration` field from `DependencyContainer` by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2385\r\n* Chore: update dependencies for distribution `2513` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2388\r\n* Docs: update CHANGELOG for `2513.0` distribution release by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2389\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/compare/2506.0...2513.0-pre\r\n\r\n## Crates Versions\r\n|  Crate  |  Version  |\r\n|---------- |-------------|\r\n| mithril-aggregator | `0.7.23` |\r\n| mithril-client | `0.11.17` |\r\n| mithril-client-cli | `0.11.11` |\r\n| mithril-client-wasm | `0.8.6` |\r\n| mithril-common | `0.5.14` |\r\n| mithril-signer | `0.2.237` |\r\n| mithril-stm | `0.3.42` |\r\n\r\n## Networks Compatibility :warning:\r\n|  Network  |  Compatible  |\r\n|---------- |:-------------:|\r\n| release-mainnet | ⛔ |\r\n| release-preprod | ⛔ |\r\n| pre-release-preview | ✔ |\r\n| testing-preview | ⛔ |\r\n\r\n## Distributions Compatibility :warning:\r\n| Compatibility | mithril-signer | mithril-client |\r\n| --- | :---: | :---: |\r\n| `2506.0` | :heavy_check_mark: | :heavy_check_mark: |\r\n| `2450.0` | :heavy_check_mark: | :heavy_check_mark: |\r\n| `2445.0` | :heavy_check_mark: | :no_entry: |\r\n\r\n## Linux Requirements\r\nThe Linux binaries target `glibc`: to run them or install the `.deb` packages you must have `glibc` version `2.35+` installed.\r\nCompatible systems include, but are not limited to, `Ubuntu 22.04+` or `Debian 12+` (Bookworm)).\r\n\r\n## Verify the authenticity of a downloaded asset\r\n<details><summary>Detailed procedure to verify an asset</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n* **Step 1**: Identify the downloaded asset on your computer ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n* **Step 2**: Download the signed checksum file from this link [CHECKSUM.asc](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2513.0-pre/CHECKSUM.asc) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 3**: In your terminal, go to the asset folder by running:\r\n```\r\ncd ***YOUR_ASSET_FOLDER***\r\n```\r\n* **Step 4**: Then verify the checksum of the asset by running:\r\n```\r\nsha256sum -c ./CHECKSUM.asc 2>/dev/null | grep ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n```\r\nYou must see:\r\n```\r\n./***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***: OK\r\n```\r\n* **Step 5**: Download the public key file from this link [public-key.gpg](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2513.0-pre/public-key.gpg) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 6**: Then import the GPG public key:\r\n```\r\ngpg --import ./public-key.gpg\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: key : public key \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" imported\r\ngpg: Total number processed: 1\r\ngpg:               imported: 1\r\n```\r\n* **Step 7**: Then verify the GPG signature of the checksum file:\r\n```\r\ngpg --verify ./CHECKSUM.asc\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: Signature made Mon 05 Dec 2022 04:53:54 PM CET\r\ngpg:                using RSA key 35EDE9D47BBA62A2F388E655899ACD26B8BCA0D2\r\ngpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" [unknown]\r\ngpg: WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature!\r\ngpg:          There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\r\nPrimary key fingerprint: 35ED E9D4 7BBA 62A2 F388  E655 899A CD26 B8BC A0D2\r\n```\r\nThe signature is valid if and only if:\r\n- there is a line with `gpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\"`\r\n- there is a line with `Primary key fingerprint: 73FC 4C3D FD55 DBDC 428A D2B5 BE04 3B79 FDA4 C2EE`\r\n* **Step 8**:\r\nIf you successfully validated all the steps of this process, then you have successfully verified the authenticity of the asset :heavy_check_mark:\r\nIf not, contact us at [mithril@iohk.io] and let us know of the outcome of your run of this process :warning:\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/208135565/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":7},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/200343016","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/200343016/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/200343016/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/tag/2506.0","id":200343016,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-a