oaded","size":5640564,"digest":null,"download_count":2,"created_at":"2024-11-05T15:16:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T15:16:25Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2445.0-pre/mithril-relay_0.1.27%2B67dc6e4-1_amd64.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/204301213","id":204301213,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4MLWOd","name":"mithril-signer_0.2.209+67dc6e4-1_amd64.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":5530264,"digest":null,"download_count":2,"created_at":"2024-11-05T15:16:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T15:16:25Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2445.0-pre/mithril-signer_0.2.209%2B67dc6e4-1_amd64.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/204301214","id":204301214,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4MLWOe","name":"public-key.gpg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":2464,"digest":null,"download_count":6,"created_at":"2024-11-05T15:16:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T15:16:24Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2445.0-pre/public-key.gpg"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/204301215","id":204301215,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4MLWOf","name":"VERSION","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":11,"digest":null,"download_count":3,"created_at":"2024-11-05T15:16:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T15:16:24Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2445.0-pre/VERSION"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/tarball/2445.0-pre","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/zipball/2445.0-pre","body":"## Highlights:\r\n- :fire: **BREAKING** changes in Mithril client library, CLI, and WASM:\r\n  - Remove deprecated `beacon` field from Mithril certificates.\r\n  - Clients from distribution [`2430`](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/tag/2430.0) and above are compatible with this change.\r\n- Stable support for **Cardano node** `10.1.2` in the signer and the aggregator.\r\n- Stable support for **Cardano stake distribution** client library, CLI and WASM.\r\n- Stable support for **Prometheus metrics** endpoint in aggregator.\r\n- Bug fixes and performance improvements.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Fix: add missing automatically generated release note section for `unstable` releases by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2011\r\n* Standardize logs in common, signer, and persistence by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2010\r\n* Sfauvel/1990/refactor prometheus metrics using struct by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1998\r\n* Feat: implement certificate chain builder for tests by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1999\r\n* Refactor client cli command parameters by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2012\r\n* Enhance logs in client and client-cli by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2013\r\n* Fix clippy warnings from Rust 1.82  by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2015\r\n* Enhance logs in mithril-relay by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2014\r\n* Upgrade mac runner + Fix incorrect param by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2019\r\n* Upgrade actions to latest by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2020\r\n* Docs: rotate documentation for `2442` distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2005\r\n* Docs: final CHANGELOG for '2442.0' distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2031\r\n* Create dev blog post for certification of Cardano stake distribution by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1892\r\n* Activate metrics endpoint on aggregator by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2022\r\n* Fix: `clap` arguments are always overriding configuration by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2038\r\n* Docs: enhance era markers runbook by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2033\r\n* Fix: monitoring configuration in infra by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2039\r\n* Fix: rename `certificate_total_produced_since_startup` metric name in aggregator by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2040\r\n* Fix unneeded rescan when importing transactions in chunk by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2035\r\n* Fix: remove `_counter` suffix from aggregator metrics by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2041\r\n* Fix: computation of the chaining of the certificates in tests by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2032\r\n* Devbook: upgrade crates and openapi script by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2042\r\n* Fix: ensure epoch consistency during epoch changes when signer is signing by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2046\r\n* Respin `testing-sanchonet` with Cardano `10.1.0-pre` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2048\r\n* Refactor event store to use migration mechanism by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2043\r\n* Enhance end-to-end tests termination by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2050\r\n* Refactor ChainPoint conversion from pallas Point by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2049\r\n* Feat: Make Cardano stake distribution stable in client by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2052\r\n* Fix: era markers and pool tools for Cardano `10.1` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2053\r\n* Remove beacon from certificate by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2055\r\n* Ensemble/1958/fix explorer by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2056\r\n* Feat: add aggregator metric to record the number of restoration of the Cardano database by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2057\r\n* Refactor: rename protocol parameters for consistency in signer and aggregator by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2058\r\n* CI: add scheduled Docker builds workflow by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2060\r\n* ci: add nightly backward compatibility testing with e2e tests by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2063\r\n* Record aggregator metrics in event store by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2059\r\n* Remove pending certificate from explorer by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2061\r\n* Access registered signers for latest epoch in explorer by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2062\r\n* Upgrade mithril explorer to Next 15 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2065\r\n* Fix metrics_per_day view and improve test by building the real Metric… by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2068\r\n* ci: update cron schedule expression with co-authors to enable notifications by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2066\r\n* Feat: Support Cardano node `10.1.1` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2070\r\n* Streamline configurations usage in aggregator by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2081\r\n* Chore: update dependencies for distribution `2445` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2078\r\n* CI: enhance nightly backward compatibility testing workflow by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2083\r\n* Chore: upgrade to Cardano '10.1.2' by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2084\r\n* Feat: add `latest` shortcut as targeted era for Cardano CLI commands by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2085\r\n* Create view for registrations monitoring by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2086\r\n* Docs: update CHANGELOG for `2445.0` distribution release by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2080\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/compare/2442.0...2445.0-pre\r\n\r\n## Crates Versions\r\n|  Crate  |  Version  |\r\n|---------- |-------------|\r\n| mithril-aggregator | `0.5.102` |\r\n| mithril-client | `0.10.1` |\r\n| mithril-client-cli | `0.10.1` |\r\n| mithril-client-wasm | `0.6.1` |\r\n| mithril-common | `0.4.79` |\r\n| mithril-signer | `0.2.209` |\r\n| mithril-stm | `0.3.31` |\r\n\r\n## Networks Compatibility :warning:\r\n|  Network  |  Compatible  |\r\n|---------- |:-------------:|\r\n| release-mainnet | ⛔ |\r\n| release-preprod | ⛔ |\r\n| pre-release-preview | ✔ |\r\n| testing-preview | ⛔ |\r\n| testing-sanchonet | ⛔ |\r\n\r\n## Distributions Compatibility :warning:\r\n| Compatibility | mithril-signer | mithril-client |\r\n| --- | :---: | :---: |\r\n| `2442.0` | ✔ | ✔|\r\n| `2437.1` | ✔ | ✔|\r\n| `2430.0` | ✔ | ✔|\r\n| `2428.0` | :no_entry: | :no_entry: |\r\n| `2423.0` | :no_entry: | :no_entry: |\r\n\r\n## Linux Requirements\r\nThe Linux binaries target `glibc`: to run them or install the `.deb` packages you must have `glibc` version `2.31+` installed.\r\nCompatible systems include, but are not limited to, `Ubuntu 20.04+` or `Debian 11+` (Bullseye)).\r\n\r\n## Verify the authenticity of a downloaded asset\r\n<details><summary>Detailed procedure to verify an asset</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n* **Step 1**: Identify the downloaded asset on your computer ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n* **Step 2**: Download the signed checksum file from this link [CHECKSUM.asc](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2445.0-pre/CHECKSUM.asc) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 3**: In your terminal, go to the asset folder by running:\r\n```\r\ncd ***YOUR_ASSET_FOLDER***\r\n```\r\n* **Step 4**: Then verify the checksum of the asset by running:\r\n```\r\nsha256sum -c ./CHECKSUM.asc 2>/dev/null | grep ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n```\r\nYou must see:\r\n```\r\n./***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***: OK\r\n```\r\n* **Step 5**: Download the public key file from this link [public-key.gpg](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2445.0-pre/public-key.gpg) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 6**: Then import the GPG public key:\r\n```\r\ngpg --import ./public-key.gpg\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: key : public key \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" imported\r\ngpg: Total number processed: 1\r\ngpg:               imported: 1\r\n```\r\n* **Step 7**: Then verify the GPG signature of the checksum file:\r\n```\r\ngpg --verify ./public-key.gpg ./CHECKSUM.asc\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: Signature made Mon 05 Dec 2022 04:53:54 PM CET\r\ngpg:                using RSA key 35EDE9D47BBA62A2F388E655899ACD26B8BCA0D2\r\ngpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" [unknown]\r\ngpg: WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature!\r\ngpg:          There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\r\nPrimary key fingerprint: 35ED E9D4 7BBA 62A2 F388  E655 899A CD26 B8BC A0D2\r\n```\r\nThe signature is valid if and only if:\r\n- there is a line with `gpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\"`\r\n- there is a line with `Primary key fingerprint: 2AC0 7B11 8B23 1443 F544 2D0C 6E2C 1160 3E79 0021`\r\n* **Step 8**:\r\nIf you successfully validated all the steps of this process, then you have successfully verified the authenticity of the asset :heavy_check_mark:\r\nIf not, contact us at [mithril@iohk.io] and let us know of the outcome of your run of this process :warning:\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","mentions_count":4},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/181009580","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/181009580/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/181009580/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/tag/2442.0","id":181