,"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":11,"digest":null,"download_count":2,"created_at":"2024-10-15T14:31:28Z","updated_at":"2024-10-15T14:31:28Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2442.0-pre/VERSION"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/tarball/2442.0-pre","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/zipball/2442.0-pre","body":"## Highlights\r\n- Stable support for **decentralized signature orchestration** (the signer node computes autonomously the messages to sign).\r\n- Stable support for **Cardano transaction client library, CLI and WASM**.\r\n- Stable support for new `Pythagoras` Mithril era.\r\n- Bug fixes and performance improvements.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Refactor signer state machine by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1931\r\n* Aggregator single signatures buffer by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1934\r\n* Retrieve custom signing configuration with epoch settings in Signer by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1939\r\n* Enhance `mithril-common` logging by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1940\r\n* Docs: rotate documentation for `2437` distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1930\r\n* Docs: final CHANGELOG for '2437.1' distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1947\r\n* Feat: create new 'Pythagoras' Mithril era by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1948\r\n* Update websites dependencies by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1937\r\n* Refactor: standardize epoch settings naming by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1949\r\n* Feat: sign protocol parameters in Genesis certificate by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1950\r\n* Refactor: signable builder services compute full protocol message by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1942\r\n* Docs: dev blog posts for `2437` distribution by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1953\r\n* Fix: hydra CI error when `allow` lint attribute specifies a reason by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1960\r\n* docs: improve clarity in \"Verify your signer is registered\" section by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1962\r\n* crane fix by @locallycompact in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1959\r\n* Fix: swagger build step failing in CI by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1965\r\n* Feat: sign protocol parameters and epoch in certificate by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1954\r\n* Fix: discrepancy protocol parameters by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1967\r\n* Make aggregator advertises constant signing configurations for an epoch by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1964\r\n* Fix: add migration to resolve deserialization issue with `cardano_transactions_signing_config` by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1971\r\n* Docs: dev blog post for activation of the Cardano transaction certification by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1973\r\n* Signer self compute signed entity by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1970\r\n* Deprecate certificate pending by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1972\r\n* Feat: Support Cardano node `9.2.1` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1969\r\n* Fix signer stuck if signature already aggregated by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1977\r\n* docs: update since signers now compute what to sign independently by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1975\r\n* Chore: decommission `testing-mainnet` network by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1978\r\n* Fix: topology computation of the Cardano nodes of the signers in infra by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1985\r\n* Signer certifier service sign & send signatures by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1979\r\n* Make epoch mandatory in `RegisterSignerMessage` by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1986\r\n* Feat: sign epoch in genesis certificate by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1987\r\n* Make Cardano transaction client stable by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1989\r\n* Optimize `/register-signer` route by replacing ticker service with epoch service by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1991\r\n* Feat: use stored signing configuration in aggregator when creating signed entity type by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1988\r\n* Feat: implement era switch in e2e tests by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1974\r\n* Enhance logs in mithril-signer and mithril-persistence by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1992\r\n* Better folder structure for End to End test by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1994\r\n* Docs: add timeout troubleshooting macOS section in E2E README by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1993\r\n* Fix: aggregator panics in CI by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1995\r\n* Refactor(aggregator): simplify http server dependencies by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1996\r\n* Use new GitHub action for creating releases by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2000\r\n* Enhance logs construction and usage in aggregator by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2002\r\n* Chore: update signer preloader refresh interval by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2003\r\n* Chore: update dependencies for distribution `2442` by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2004\r\n* Docs: update CHANGELOG for `2442.0` distribution release by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2006\r\n* setting benchmark path by @Fuma419 in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1951\r\n* Fix: update dependencies runbook and script by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2008\r\n* Use new GitHub action for creating `unstable` release by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2007\r\n* Rework & harmonize aggregator log messages by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2009\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @locallycompact made their first contribution in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1959\r\n* @Fuma419 made their first contribution in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1951\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/compare/2437.1...2442.0-pre\r\n\r\n## Crates Versions\r\n|  Crate  |  Version  |\r\n|---------- |-------------|\r\n| mithril-aggregator | `0.5.83` |\r\n| mithril-client | `0.9.2` |\r\n| mithril-client-cli | `0.9.15` |\r\n| mithril-client-wasm | `0.5.2` |\r\n| mithril-common | `0.4.69` |\r\n| mithril-signer | `0.2.200` |\r\n| mithril-stm | `0.3.30` |\r\n\r\n## Networks Compatibility :warning:\r\n|  Network  |  Compatible  |\r\n|---------- |:-------------:|\r\n| release-mainnet | ⛔ |\r\n| release-preprod | ⛔ |\r\n| pre-release-preview | ✔ |\r\n| testing-preview | ⛔ |\r\n| testing-sanchonet | ⛔ |\r\n\r\n## Linux Requirements\r\nThe Linux binaries target `glibc`: to run them or install the `.deb` packages you must have `glibc` version `2.31+` installed.\r\nCompatible systems include, but are not limited to, `Ubuntu 20.04+` or `Debian 11+` (Bullseye)).\r\n\r\n## Verify the authenticity of a downloaded asset\r\n<details><summary>Detailed procedure to verify an asset</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n* **Step 1**: Identify the downloaded asset on your computer ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n* **Step 2**: Download the signed checksum file from this link [CHECKSUM.asc](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2442.0-pre/CHECKSUM.asc) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 3**: In your terminal, go to the asset folder by running:\r\n```\r\ncd ***YOUR_ASSET_FOLDER***\r\n```\r\n* **Step 4**: Then verify the checksum of the asset by running:\r\n```\r\nsha256sum -c ./CHECKSUM.asc 2>/dev/null | grep ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n```\r\nYou must see:\r\n```\r\n./***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***: OK\r\n```\r\n* **Step 5**: Download the public key file from this link [public-key.gpg](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2442.0-pre/public-key.gpg) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 6**: Then import the GPG public key:\r\n```\r\ngpg --import ./public-key.gpg\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: key : public key \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" imported\r\ngpg: Total number processed: 1\r\ngpg:               imported: 1\r\n```\r\n* **Step 7**: Then verify the GPG signature of the checksum file:\r\n```\r\ngpg --verify ./public-key.gpg ./CHECKSUM.asc\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: Signature made Mon 05 Dec 2022 04:53:54 PM CET\r\ngpg:                using RSA key 35EDE9D47BBA62A2F388E655899ACD26B8BCA0D2\r\ngpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" [unknown]\r\ngpg: WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature!\r\ngpg:          There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\r\nPrimary key fingerprint: 35ED E9D4 7BBA 62A2 F388  E655 899A CD26 B8BC A0D2\r\n```\r\nThe signature is valid if and only if:\r\n- there is a line with `gpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\"`\r\n- there is a line with `Primary key fingerprint: 2AC0 7B11 8B23 1443 F544 2D0C 6E2C 1160 3E79 0021`\r\n* **Step 8**:\r\nIf you successfully validated all the steps of this process, then you have successfully verified the authenticity of the asset :heavy_check_mark:\r\nIf not, contact us at [mithril@iohk.io] and let us know of the outcome of your run of this process :warning:\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/180031385/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":5},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/176387993","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/176387993/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/176387993/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/tag/2437.1","id":176387993,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com