created_at":"2024-09-12T08:22:11Z","updated_at":"2024-09-12T08:22:12Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2437.0-pre/public-key.gpg"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/assets/192153313","id":192153313,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGBJN7M4LdAbh","name":"VERSION","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":11,"digest":null,"download_count":3,"created_at":"2024-09-12T08:22:04Z","updated_at":"2024-09-12T08:22:04Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2437.0-pre/VERSION"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/tarball/2437.0-pre","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/zipball/2437.0-pre","body":"## Highlights:\r\n- :fire: **BREAKING** changes in **Mithril client WASM**:\r\n  - Implementation of seamless transition from **unstable** to **stable** features.\r\n  - A new `unstable` option in the client allows the usage of unstable features.\r\n  - The previous `client.unstable` implementation is not supported anymore and must be replaced with `client`.\r\n- Stable support for **Cardano transactions** certification in signer and aggregator.\r\n- Stable support for **Cardano stake distribution** certification in signer and aggregator.\r\n- Bug fixes and performance improvements.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Implement signable and artifact builders for Cardano Stake Distribution by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1847\r\n* Increase timeout for client WASM headless browser tests by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1864\r\n* Fix typos by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1865\r\n* Update CHANGELOG for `2430.0` distribution release by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1866\r\n* Dev blog post for `Cardano transaction certification` feature roll-out by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1868\r\n* Make signed_entity_type non optional in RegisterSignatureMessage by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1870\r\n* Monitor Mithril nodes footprint by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1871\r\n* Add a redirection on index.html to clean url by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1869\r\n* Escape slashes in sed command by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1873\r\n* Update Mithril signer footprint with Cardano transactions by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1874\r\n* Fix: `ChainReaderBlockStreamer` skips `RollForward` blocks at the tip by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1877\r\n* Implement Cardano stake distribution HTTP routes by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1872\r\n* Update Mithril signer footprint in SPO guide by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1879\r\n* Implement Cardano stake distribution in `mithril-client` library by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1882\r\n* Implement Cardano stake distribution commands in `mithril-client` CLI by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1883\r\n* Implement Cardano stake distribution in `mithril-client` WASM by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1887\r\n* Add new tab Cardano Stake Distribution in the explorer by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1888\r\n* Document Cardano Stake Distribution by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1889\r\n* Add missing Cardano stake distribution example in developer documentation by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1891\r\n* fix: macOS e2e local tests fails on M3 silicon processors by @falcucci in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1767\r\n* Add support for custom HTTP Headers in Mithril client WASM library by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1890\r\n* Create repository dependencies upgrade runbook by @dlachaume in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1893\r\n* feat: support `file://` URLs for snapshot locations by @michalrus in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1885\r\n* Fix: Cardano stake distribution certification epoch discrepancy by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1896\r\n* Optimize memory usage of signer for Cardano transactions by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1904\r\n* Add Cardano transactions signing configuration in Aggregator '/' route by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1905\r\n* Reorganize signer dependencies by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1908\r\n* docs: update signer footprint in SPO setup guide by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1907\r\n* Optional signed message in registered signatures by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1909\r\n* feat: Make `rug-backend` optional for `mithril-client` crate by @Mr-Leshiy in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1884\r\n* Chore: post `Chang` hard fork cleanup by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1912\r\n* Refactor: seamless `unstable` to `stable` transition in WASM client by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1914\r\n* Fix clippy warnings from Rust 1.81 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1918\r\n* Add a script to update all dependencies by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1916\r\n* Feat: add infinite Cardano transactions preloader in signer by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1921\r\n* Update dependencies for release 2437 by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1919\r\n* Enhance upgrade dependency runbook by @Alenar in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1926\r\n* Fix: preloading configuration makes signer panic at startup by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1927\r\n* signer retrieves registrations with epoch settings route by @sfauvel in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1913\r\n* Enhance Cardano transactions rollbacks by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1917\r\n* Update CHANGELOG for `2437.0` distribution release by @jpraynaud in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1932\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @michalrus made their first contribution in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1885\r\n* @Mr-Leshiy made their first contribution in https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/1884\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/compare/2430.0...2437.0-pre\r\n\r\n\r\n## Crates Versions\r\n|  Crate  |  Version  |\r\n|---------- |-------------|\r\n| mithril-aggregator | `0.5.62` |\r\n| mithril-client | `0.8.18` |\r\n| mithril-client-cli | `0.9.12` |\r\n| mithril-client-wasm | `0.4.1` |\r\n| mithril-common | `0.4.51` |\r\n| mithril-signer | `0.2.181` |\r\n| mithril-stm | `0.3.29` |\r\n\r\n## Networks Compatibility :warning:\r\n|  Network  |  Compatible  |\r\n|---------- |:-------------:|\r\n| release-mainnet | ⛔ |\r\n| release-preprod | ⛔ |\r\n| pre-release-preview | ✔ |\r\n| testing-preview | ⛔ |\r\n| testing-sanchonet | ⛔ |\r\n\r\n## Linux Requirements\r\nThe Linux binaries target `glibc`: to run them or install the `.deb` packages you must have `glibc` version `2.31+` installed.\r\nCompatible systems include, but are not limited to, `Ubuntu 20.04+` or `Debian 11+` (Bullseye)).\r\n\r\n## Verify the authenticity of a downloaded asset\r\n<details><summary>Detailed procedure to verify an asset</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n* **Step 1**: Identify the downloaded asset on your computer ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n* **Step 2**: Download the signed checksum file from this link [CHECKSUM.asc](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2437.0-pre/CHECKSUM.asc) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 3**: In your terminal, go to the asset folder by running:\r\n```\r\ncd ***YOUR_ASSET_FOLDER***\r\n```\r\n* **Step 4**: Then verify the checksum of the asset by running:\r\n```\r\nsha256sum -c ./CHECKSUM.asc 2>/dev/null | grep ***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***\r\n```\r\nYou must see:\r\n```\r\n./***YOUR_ASSET_FILE***: OK\r\n```\r\n* **Step 5**: Download the public key file from this link [public-key.gpg](https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/download/2437.0-pre/public-key.gpg) and save it in the same folder as the asset\r\n* **Step 6**: Then import the GPG public key:\r\n```\r\ngpg --import ./public-key.gpg\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: key : public key \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" imported\r\ngpg: Total number processed: 1\r\ngpg:               imported: 1\r\n```\r\n* **Step 7**: Then verify the GPG signature of the checksum file:\r\n```\r\ngpg --verify ./public-key.gpg ./CHECKSUM.asc\r\n```\r\nYou must see something like:\r\n```\r\ngpg: Signature made Mon 05 Dec 2022 04:53:54 PM CET\r\ngpg:                using RSA key 35EDE9D47BBA62A2F388E655899ACD26B8BCA0D2\r\ngpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\" [unknown]\r\ngpg: WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature!\r\ngpg:          There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\r\nPrimary key fingerprint: 35ED E9D4 7BBA 62A2 F388  E655 899A CD26 B8BC A0D2\r\n```\r\nThe signature is valid if and only if:\r\n- there is a line with `gpg: Good signature from \"Input Output / Mithril <mithril@iohk.io>\"`\r\n- there is a line with `Primary key fingerprint: 2AC0 7B11 8B23 1443 F544 2D0C 6E2C 1160 3E79 0021`\r\n* **Step 8**:\r\nIf you successfully validated all the steps of this process, then you have successfully verified the authenticity of the asset :heavy_check_mark:\r\nIf not, contact us at [mithril@iohk.io] and let us know of the outcome of your run of this process :warning:\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","mentions_count":7},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/167795478","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/167795478/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/167795478/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/tag/2430.0","id":167795478,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/gi